trainmeet.drift-1.event.LocalReleaseSet.description:
A local area asked for, given or refused, or ended (TKL44, TKL48). asked: the request,
answer or end came over the protocol (#36 del b), and the station switches it when it can;
without, it is what the station's route.state showed.

trainmeet.drift-1.event.AutomatSet.description:
A station automat switched on or off, by someone or by itself (FR25, FR29). asked: whoever
controls the station decided it with automat.set (#36 del b), and the station switches it;
without, it is what the station's route.state showed.

trainmeet.planning-1.draft.RemoteAreaCha.description:
Ett fjärrområde i utkastet (PLAN-04, PLAN-33, FR49): a name and a row of driftplatser that
hangs together along the line. Each of them is planned as remote-controlled from the area;
a place taken out of the area is manned again. No name takes the area away.

